{"id": "1545253360041463850", "channel_id": "1545253360041463850", "author_id": "806384001895890965", "author_name": "0.0._.0_0.", "content": "在幾個月前推薦過+12凱刻斯\n現在到了新環境 凱刻斯依然是我推薦練的常駐角色\n不過 現在要綁卡拉布才可以打高難", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T02:05:10.453000+00:00", "thread_id": "1545253360041463850", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-04T02:05:26.173000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1545253426579898439", "filename": "IMG_3570.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2024968, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545253360041463850/1545253426579898439/IMG_3570.png?ex=6a9b78e6&is=6a9a2766&hm=b9d37abdf33d78f79a3583d1df30f5fa9cc08490655c4aae8fdebba4f90a4c3d&"}, {"id": "1545253427641065614", "filename": "IMG_3575.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1948544, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545253360041463850/1545253427641065614/IMG_3575.png?ex=6a9b78e6&is=6a9a2766&hm=d8341a73a9a344e18dea7113ccedb53165f6d96ac1cb1c883e734ae3d4bc133d&"}], "thread_title": "+12凱 卡拉布", "forum_channel_id": "1174179624096378930", "thread_tags": ["1174179734373019748", "1174179716706619494"], "is_thread_starter": true}
